<title>USA: Fort Howard names Riordan as chairman.</title>
<headline>Fort Howard names Riordan as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Howard Corp said Michael Riordan is assuming the role of chairman in addition to his duties as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Donald DeMeuse, who retired after a 30-year career with the sanitary tissue product company.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
